{"title":"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 0 Problem B","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_0_Problem_B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> be TNYWR.<br />What is the area of a triangle with base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/5/f65450756c44b33df63c304f031fdfc2751a0d56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2t$\" width=\"15\" height=\"12\" /> and height <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/e/17e069bbf4f0b664abce98bff0323be847a3a679.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3t-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" />? \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_0_Problem_B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Area\" title=\"Area\">area</a> of a triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/4/5c4ae681c4cf5ec73b7d8dc2a5fa638e9da45ba1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = \\frac{1}{2}bh$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"71\" height=\"38\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> is the area of the triangle, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is the base of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Triangle\" title=\"Triangle\">triangle</a> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8189a5b5a0917b8c93350827be4038af1839139d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is the height of the triangle. Using this, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/3/253bb41bfe58f12fab1482c241de8ca3a1f9ea5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 2t \\times (3t - 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"174\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/a/9eaee1cc74b0e1268646dcc559d45128472ce50b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = t(3t - 1) = 3t^{2} - t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"184\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_0_Problem_A\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 0 Problem A\">seat A</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/b/d5bc2ef78516fb01003693c823d005e12e9c756f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"42\" height=\"14\" />. Plugging this into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/0/90046b1235984636ab067118555ba92f0c22e611.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = 3t^{2} - 3t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"18\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/6/bf67fd1af4f93ee922ea69ffe5026e90aa57ec16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = 3 \\times 5^{2} - 5 = 3 \\times 25 - 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"224\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/6/b361483bcf20592015a4c977b232ca63827cf09a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=75 - 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/7/62781959a61b638cd40e65ce9d6f0b1fd20611dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{70}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"50\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC\">2017 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_0_Problem_A\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 0 Problem A\">Relay 0 Problem A</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_0_Problem_C\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 0 Problem C\">Relay 0 Problem C</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_1\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 1\">Individual 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Individual 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_3\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Indiv